From c2a889dccb3a2296a6f607559d06fbfbeac82137 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 12:15:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign visual identity: light minimal luxury with
 full-bleed photography

Moves the site from a rounded, filled-gold-pill look to a lighter, more
restrained aesthetic inspired by the studio's own brand lockup: elegant
serif display headings (English), thin hairline borders and bordered
(no-fill) icon containers instead of gold pills/badges, a sharp rounded-sm
corner convention throughout, and a transparent-over-hero header on the
homepage.

Adds a new full-bleed hero and a portfolio-style "Selected Work" section to
the homepage, plus a CSS-only PlaceholderImage component (elegant gradient
placeholders, swappable for real photography later) used across the home,
about, and service detail pages. Relocates the brand lockup to a proper
signature band on the About page instead of a stretched "photo panel".
